{"3737120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spookshow", "steam_appid": 3737120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737120/extras/b3108e1726c54eb9e01374ca1357ced2.poster.avif?t=1768272375\" width=568 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737120/extras/b3108e1726c54eb9e01374ca1357ced2.webm?t=1768272375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good evening boys and ghouls...you're about to witness the Spookshow. Where every nights episode has one victim...YOU! <br><br>Step into the world of <strong>Spookshow</strong>, the forgotten horror television phenomenon of the 90's, where every time you play you step into an episode of the cult classic — <i>where you write the story</i>. Play solo or with friends as characters trapped in deadly tales, or take control of the monster and rewrite the script in <strong>blood</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match characters, monsters, and maps to create your own terrifying TV episode, packed with campy scares, puzzles, chills, thrills, and cinematic kills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737120/extras/4ed722ff4b223723b97c2f220735742a.poster.avif?t=1768272375\" width=568 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737120/extras/4ed722ff4b223723b97c2f220735742a.webm?t=1768272375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play With Friends, or Alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone for a classic horror experience, or team up with up to 4 players in online multiplayer. One player can take on the role of the monster — or leave it to the AI for a terrifying co-op expirience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play the Victims...or the Monster</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a cast of characters — the Teenagers, the Repair Men, the Security Guards, the Priests, and more — each with their own objectives and to-die-for intro sequences. Use stealth, tools, and teamwork to survive the night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or...become the nightmare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each monster has unique abilities, movement rules, and win conditions. From shadow-dwelling killers to reality-bending poltergeists, every monster offers a new way to terrorize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737120/extras/77abe5055671f456ed57885afc94fb23.poster.avif?t=1768272375\" width=568 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737120/extras/77abe5055671f456ed57885afc94fb23.webm?t=1768272375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayable Episodes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is an episode. Select your character, monster, and map to generate a unique scenario. From haunted campgrounds to derelict carnival rides, no two shows are the same. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere-Rich Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn off lights to hide. Break down doors to escape. Use flashlights, flares, and found tools to manipulate your environment and survive. The monster is watching — and learning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Love Letter to Campy Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by shows like <i>Tales from the Crypt</i> and <i>Are You Afraid of the Dark?</i>, <i>Spookshow</i> delivers laughs, frights, and style in equal measure. Each match begins with a live-action host intro and ends in screams. Can you survive the episode?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737120/extras/b3108e1726c54eb9e01374ca1357ced2.poster.avif?t=1768272375\" width=568 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737120/extras/b3108e1726c54eb9e01374ca1357ced2.webm?t=1768272375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good evening boys and ghouls...you're about to witness the Spookshow. Where every nights episode has one victim...YOU! <br><br>Step into the world of <strong>Spookshow</strong>, the forgotten horror television phenomenon of the 90's, where every time you play you step into an episode of the cult classic — <i>where you write the story</i>. Play solo or with friends as characters trapped in deadly tales, or take control of the monster and rewrite the script in <strong>blood</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match characters, monsters, and maps to create your own terrifying TV episode, packed with campy scares, puzzles, chills, thrills, and cinematic kills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737120/extras/4ed722ff4b223723b97c2f220735742a.poster.avif?t=1768272375\" width=568 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737120/extras/4ed722ff4b223723b97c2f220735742a.webm?t=1768272375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play With Friends, or Alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone for a classic horror experience, or team up with up to 4 players in online multiplayer. One player can take on the role of the monster — or leave it to the AI for a terrifying co-op expirience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play the Victims...or the Monster</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a cast of characters — the Teenagers, the Repair Men, the Security Guards, the Priests, and more — each with their own objectives and to-die-for intro sequences. Use stealth, tools, and teamwork to survive the night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or...become the nightmare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each monster has unique abilities, movement rules, and win conditions. From shadow-dwelling killers to reality-bending poltergeists, every monster offers a new way to terrorize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737120/extras/77abe5055671f456ed57885afc94fb23.poster.avif?t=1768272375\" width=568 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737120/extras/77abe5055671f456ed57885afc94fb23.webm?t=1768272375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayable Episodes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is an episode. Select your character, monster, and map to generate a unique scenario. From haunted campgrounds to derelict carnival rides, no two shows are the same. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere-Rich Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn off lights to hide. Break down doors to escape. Use flashlights, flares, and found tools to manipulate your environment and survive. The monster is watching — and learning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Love Letter to Campy Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by shows like <i>Tales from the Crypt</i> and <i>Are You Afraid of the Dark?</i>, <i>Spookshow</i> delivers laughs, frights, and style in equal measure. Each match begins with a live-action host intro and ends in screams. Can you survive the episode?</p>", "short_description": "Spookshow is a retro horror game where you play solo or with friends as the unlucky stars of a 1990's midnight TV Show. Create your episode by selecting your map, monster, and character, then fight to survive each terrifying tale — or step into the monster’s shoes and make the show a scream.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737120/589bdfa3cc4f3ff543e8700c810309158442f982/header.jpg?t=1768272375", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737120/8bba660ba739eea769fa9b3997ed3abeb6f4ba79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768272375", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737120/8bba660ba739eea769fa9b3997ed3abeb6f4ba79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768272375", "website": "https://dotwaregames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 / AMD Radeon R9 390<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10600 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA RTX 2060 / AMD Radeon RX 5700<br></li><li><strong>DirectX: